| `s` | Surround word |
| `vv` | Select word |

## Visual mode

| Key | What |
|---|---|
| `<Down>` | Move selection down |
| `<Up>` | Move selection up |
| `<` | Outdent and reselect |
| `>` | Indent and reselect |
| `J` | Down 5 lines |
